.TH SONDE 1 "2026-11-11" "sonde 0.2.0" "Sonde Manual"
.SH NAME
sonde \- D-Bus inspection and debugging tool
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sonde
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Sonde
is a graphical D-Bus observer.  It browses services, object paths,
interfaces, methods, signals and properties; reads and writes properties;
calls methods with signature-driven argument forms; and shows the live
message stream with field-based filtering.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-bus " " session|system
Bus to monitor (default: session).
.TP
.BI \-\-service " dest"
Open this service on startup.
.TP
.B \-\-dark ", " \-\-light
Select the theme explicitly (default: follow the system).
.TP
.BI \-\-filter " query"
Set the message filter expression and start monitoring.
.TP
.BI \-\-call " iface.member"
Call a method without opening the UI and print the result as JSON.
.TP
.BI \-\-call-dest " dest"
.TQ
.BI \-\-call-path " path"
.TQ
.BI \-\-call-sig " sig"
.TQ
.BI \-\-call-args " json"
Destination, object path, argument signature and JSON argument array
for
.BR \-\-call .
.TP
.BR \-\-demo
Self-test: start monitoring, open a service and run one method call.
.TP
.BI \-\-screenshot " path"
Render one frame, save it as a PNG and exit.
.TP
.BR \-\-dump-tree
Print the rows of the introspection tree and exit.
.SH SEE ALSO
The project README at
.UR https://github.com/mhduiy/sonde
.UE
.
